  "notes": "USAGE: Often used in business and technical contexts for implementing new systems, technologies, or policies.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {導入|どうにゅう}する (to introduce/implement)\n- {導入|どうにゅう}コスト (implementation cost)\n- {導入|どうにゅう}{事例|じれい} (case studies of implementation)\n- {段階的|だんかいてき}{導入|どうにゅう} (phased implementation)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {採用|さいよう} (adoption)\n- {実施|じっし} (implementation - for policies/plans)",
